Usage: wukong [options] [command]

Wukong — The human drives; the machine moves. (formerly treadle)

Options:
  -V, --version      output the version number
  -h, --help         display help for command

Commands:
  do                 the loop plane: init, add, next, record, answer, approve,
                     close, check, status
  init               stand something up: harness — the interactive installer
  know               the knowledge plane: search, read, validate, links,
                     findings, fingerprints, anchors, status
  start
  stop
  status
  project            connect explicit trusted local workspaces
  context [options]
  package
  help [command]     display help for command
